---
/**
 * TODO: have this reviewed before launch.
 * Written with Sri Lanka's Personal Data Protection Act No. 9 of 2022 (PDPA) in mind, but it is not
 * legal advice. Please have a lawyer check it, in particular:
 * - the retention period (24 months is a placeholder — set your real policy)
 * - the registered company name and address once confirmed (site.ts)
 * - whether you need to name a Data Protection Officer
 * Update `updated` below whenever the content changes.
 */
import LegalPage from '../components/sections/LegalPage.astro';
import { site, emailHref } from '../data/site';

const updated = '2026-10-18';

const sections = [
  { id: 'who-we-are', title: 'Who we are' },
  { id: 'what-we-collect', title: 'What we collect' },
  { id: 'why-we-use-it', title: 'Why we use it' },
  { id: 'who-we-share-it-with', title: 'Who we share it with' },
  { id: 'how-long-we-keep-it', title: 'How long we keep it' },
  { id: 'keeping-it-safe', title: 'Keeping it safe' },
  { id: 'your-rights', title: 'Your rights' },
  { id: 'changes', title: 'Changes to this policy' },
  { id: 'contact', title: 'Contact us' },
];
---

<LegalPage
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How MuchLogic collects, uses and protects the personal data you share through our website, in line with Sri Lanka’s Personal Data Protection Act."
  updated={updated}
  sections={sections}
>
  <section id="who-we-are" aria-labelledby="who-we-are-title">
    <h2 id="who-we-are-title">Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      {site.name} is a software company based in {site.location.country}. This policy explains what
      personal data we collect through this website, why we collect it, and what you can ask us to
      do with it. We wrote it with Sri Lanka’s <strong>Personal Data Protection Act No. 9 of 2022</strong>{' '}
      (PDPA) in mind.
    </p>
    <p>
      For this website, {site.name} is the <strong>controller</strong> of your personal data: we decide
      how it is used and we are responsible for it.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="what-we-collect" aria-labelledby="what-we-collect-title">
    <h2 id="what-we-collect-title">What we collect</h2>
    <h3>When you use our contact form</h3>
    <p>We only collect what you type into the form:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>your name, email address and phone number</li>
      <li>your company and website, if you add them</li>
      <li>the service you’re interested in and your budget range</li>
      <li>the project details you write</li>
      <li>that you agreed to this privacy policy</li>
    </ul>
    <h3>When you browse the website</h3>
    <p>
      Our hosting provider keeps short-lived technical logs, such as your IP address, browser type and
      the pages requested, to keep the site running and secure. We don’t use analytics, advertising or
      tracking cookies, and we don’t build profiles of visitors.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="why-we-use-it" aria-labelledby="why-we-use-it-title">
    <h2 id="why-we-use-it-title">Why we use it</h2>
    <p>We use the details you send us to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>reply to your inquiry and arrange a discovery call</li>
      <li>prepare a proposal or quote if you ask for one</li>
      <li>keep a record of our conversation so we can help you better later</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      We process this data because you gave us your <strong>consent</strong> when you sent the form, and
      because it is needed to take the steps you asked for before any contract. You can withdraw your
      consent at any time (see <a href="#your-rights">Your rights</a>).
    </p>
    <p>We won’t send you marketing emails or add you to a mailing list.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="who-we-share-it-with" aria-labelledby="who-we-share-it-with-title">
    <h2 id="who-we-share-it-with-title">Who we share it with</h2>
    <p>
      <strong>We never sell your personal data</strong>, and we don’t share it with anyone for their own
      marketing. We use a few trusted service providers to run the website and deliver your message to
      us. They only process your data on our behalf:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <strong>Vercel</strong> hosts this website and runs the contact form.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Resend</strong> delivers your inquiry to our inbox by email.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>CallMeBot</strong>, a third-party notification service, sends a copy of your inquiry to
        our WhatsApp so we can reply quickly. The message is delivered through{' '}
        <strong>WhatsApp</strong>.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Some of these providers store or process data outside {site.location.country}, for example in the
      United States or the European Union. When that happens, we rely on them to protect your data with
      safeguards that meet the standard the PDPA expects.
    </p>
    <p>We may also share data if the law requires it, for example to answer a valid legal request.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="how-long-we-keep-it" aria-labelledby="how-long-we-keep-it-title">
    <h2 id="how-long-we-keep-it-title">How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>
      We keep inquiry details for up to <strong>24 months</strong> after our last contact with you, so we
      can follow up on your project. If you become a client, we keep what we need for as long as we work
      together and for as long as the law requires for business records. After that, we delete it.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="keeping-it-safe" aria-labelledby="keeping-it-safe-title">
    <h2 id="keeping-it-safe-title">Keeping it safe</h2>
    <p>
      The website uses HTTPS, so your form is encrypted on its way to us. Only the people at {site.name}{' '}
      who need your details to answer you can see them, and we use secure, access-controlled accounts
      with our service providers.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="your-rights" aria-labelledby="your-rights-title">
    <h2 id="your-rights-title">Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under the PDPA you can ask us to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>tell you what personal data we hold about you and give you a copy</li>
      <li>correct data that is wrong or incomplete</li>
      <li><strong>delete your data</strong></li>
      <li>stop using your data, or withdraw the consent you gave</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      To ask for any of these, including to have your data deleted, email us at{' '}
      <a href={emailHref}>{site.email}</a> from the address you used in the form. We’ll confirm it’s you
      and reply within 21 working days.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you’re not happy with how we handled your request, you can complain to the{' '}
      <strong>Data Protection Authority of Sri Lanka</strong>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="changes" aria-labelledby="changes-title">
    <h2 id="changes-title">Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      If we change how we use personal data, we’ll update this page and the “last updated” date at the
      top.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-title">
    <h2 id="contact-title">Contact us</h2>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy or your data? Email <a href={emailHref}>{site.email}</a> or use our{' '}
      <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalPage>
